ed from the old reports.\n\nJackDev October 7, 2025, 3:54pm 4\n\nHey vb, yeah same issue here again\n\nimage996×1186 18.8 KB\n\n[Nest] 37 - 10/07/2025, 3:42:56 PM ERROR [ExceptionsHandler] 500 The server had an error processing your request. Sorry about that! You can retry your request, or contact us through our help center at help.openai.com if you keep seeing this error.\n\nError: 500 The server had an error processing your request. Sorry about that! You can retry your request, or contact us through our help center at help.openai.com if you keep seeing this error.\n\nturtle-system October 7, 2025, 3:52pm 5\n\nPlease be more responsive this time!\n\nVeitB October 7, 2025, 3:56pm 6\n\nThank you for flagging this issue. This has been escalated to staff.\n\nVeitB October 7, 2025, 5:07pm 7\n\n@OpenAI_Support shared an update that the issue is resolved now.\n\nIn case you are still experiencing issues, you can share them here.--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nWhat is the training data knowledge cutoff date for text-embedding-3-large? - API - OpenAI Developer Community (https://community.openai.com/t/what-is-the-training-data-knowledge-cutoff-date-for-text-embedding-3-large/1361283)\nciteturn2638search8 [wordlim: 200] Published: last year; Crawled: last year; mzhu0114 October 7, 2025, 12:05am 1\n\n# What is the training data knowledge cutoff date for text-embedding-3-large?\n\nembeddings, api-embedding\n\nmzhu0114 October 7, 2025, 12:05am 1\n\nI am currently working with the `text-embedding-3-large` model and would like clarification on its knowledge cutoff date. Could anyone please confirm what the knowledge cutoff date is for `text-embedding-3-large`? Is it the same as `text-embedding-ada-002` (September 2021), or has it been extended with the release of the v3 embeddings?\n\naprendendo.next October 7, 2025, 12:17am 2\n\nWelcome to the forum.\n\nProbably the same date.\n\n> ### Do V3 embedding models know about recent events?\n> \n> No, the `text-embedding-3-large` and `text-embedding-3-small` models lack knowledge of events that occurred after September 2021. This is generally not as much of a limitation as it would be for text generation models but in certain edge cases it can reduce performance.--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nModel cards — Google DeepMind (https://deepmind.google/models/model-cards/)\nciteturn2638search9 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: yesterday; Gemini 3.5 Flash-Lite  | Updated 21 July 2026  | View model card ... Gemini 2.5 Computer Use  | Updated 7 October 2025  | View model card\n\n# Model cards\n\nSimple, structured overviews of how an advanced AI model was designed and evaluated.\n\n## Gemini\n\nOur most intelligent AI models\n\nModel card  | Published or updated date  | Link to model card\n--- | --- | ---\nGemini 3.8 Audio (Live, Live Extended Thinking, Flash TTS, Flash-Lite TTS)  | Updated 24 September 2026  | View model card\nGemini 3.8 Flash  | Updated 2 September 2026  | View model card\nGemini Omni Flash  | Updated 27 August 2026  | View model card\nGemini 3.5 Audio (Live Translate, Transcribe, Transcribe Live)  | Updated 26 August 2026  | View model card\nGemini 3.7 Flash  | Updated 13 August 2026  | View model card\nGemini 3.6 Flash  | Updated 21 July 2026  | View model card\nGemini 3.5 Flash-Lite  | Updated 21 July 2026  | View model card\nGemini 3.1 Flash-Lite Image  | Updated 30 June 2026  | View model card\nGemini 3.5 Flash  | Updated 19 May 2026  | View model card\nGemini 3.1 Flash Audio (Flash Live, TTS)  | Updated 15 April 2026  | View model card\nGemini 3.1 Flash-Lite  | Updated 3 March 2026  | View model card\nGemini 3.1 Flash Image  | Updated 26 February 2026  | View model card\nGemini 3.1 Pro  | Updated 19 February 2026  | View model card\nGemini 3 Flash  | Updated 17 December 2025  | View model card\nGemini 3 Pro Image  | Updated 20 November 2025  | View model card\nGemini 3 Pro  | Updated 1